"},{"text":"Chemical handling"},{"text":"Technical reporting"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Basic statistical analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Build 5–7 practical projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Polymer blend-property optimisation"},{"text":"Biodegradable polymer formulation study"},{"text":"FTIR-based polymer identification"},{"text":"Recycled-plastic property comparison"},{"text":"Polymer ageing/degradation study"},{"text":"Polymer composite development"},{"text":"Processing condition vs mechanical-property analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong final-year project should demonstrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Material selection","formulation/process","testing","data analysis","property comparison","industrial recommendation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Polymer R&D"},{"text":"Polymer chemistry, formulation, characterisation"},{"text":"Research labs + industry"},{"text":"Polymer R&D Specialist"}],[{"text":"Polymer Processing"},{"text":"Extrusion, injection moulding, rheology"},{"text":"Manufacturing projects"},{"text":"Process Technologist"}],[{"text":"Materials Testing"},{"text":"FTIR, DSC, TGA, mechanical testing"},{"text":"Testing laboratories"},{"text":"Materials Specialist"}],[{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"SPC, QC, ISO, testing"},{"text":"Quality laboratories"},{"text":"Quality Manager"}],[{"text":"Composites"},{"text":"Fibres, resins, interfaces, testing"},{"text":"Materials research"},{"text":"Composite Materials Specialist"}],[{"text":"Rubber/Elastomers"},{"text":"Compounding, vulcanisation, rheology"},{"text":"Rubber industry"},{"text":"Elastomer Specialist"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Polymers"},{"text":"Recycling, biopolymers, LCA"},{"text":"Sustainability research"},{"text":"Sustainable Materials Specialist"}],[{"text":"Technical Services"},{"text":"Failure analysis, product performance"},{"te